# new-screen
Context:
- Screens in client/ package, extend AbstractContainerScreen or base class BaseMachineSoulScreen
- Matching menu in menu/ package, extend AbstractContainerMenu
- Registration: ModMenus.java (DeferredRegister<MenuType>)
- Client-side registration: ClientSetup.java (MenuScreens.register)
- Network: uses existing ModPackets pattern for server↔client sync
- GUI textures: src/main/resources/assets/cbc_autotarget/textures/gui/

Steps:
1. Ask: "Screen name? Extend BaseMachineSoulScreen or AbstractContainerScreen directly? Has inventory slots? Texture file name?"
2. Generate Menu class with correct ContainerData or custom data sync if needed.
3. Generate Screen class with renderBg, renderLabels, init overrides.
4. Register MenuType in ModMenus.
5. Add MenuScreens.register call in ClientSetup.
6. Generate empty texture placeholder path comment.
7. Show all files labeled.